sequenceDiagram
actor User
participant Client
participant "Reaction Controller" as Controller
participant "Reaction Service" as Service
participant "Reaction Repository" as Repo
database DB

User ->> Client: View post reactions
Client ->> Controller: GET /posts/:postId/reactions/summary

Controller ->> Service: getPostReactionSummary(postId)

Service ->> Repo: countLikesAndDislikes(postId)
Repo ->> DB: COUNT likes and dislikes
DB -->> Repo: Summary
Repo -->> Service: {likes, dislikes}

Service -->> Controller: Summary
Controller -->> Client: 200 OK